PE 834: Add and Divide / 加与除

=== Problem Statement ===
A process: start with n, repeatedly apply: if even, divide
by 2; if odd, add 1 (then divide by 2 next step).
Count the steps needed to reach 1.

=== Small n Steps ===
  n= 1 → 0 steps ()
  n= 2 → 1 steps (/2)
  n= 3 → 3 steps (+1→/2→/2)
  n= 4 → 2 steps (/2→/2)
  n= 5 → 5 steps (+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n= 6 → 4 steps (/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n= 7 → 4 steps (+1→/2→/2→/2)
  n= 8 → 3 steps (/2→/2→/2)
  n= 9 → 7 steps (+1→/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=10 → 6 steps (/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=11 → 6 steps (+1→/2→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=12 → 5 steps (/2→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=13 → 6 steps (+1→/2→+1→/2→/2→/2)
  n=14 → 5 steps (/2→+1→/2→/2→/2)
  n=15 → 5 steps (+1→/2→/2→/2→/2)
  n=16 → 4 steps (/2→/2→/2→/2)
  n=17 → 9 steps (+1→/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=18 → 8 steps (/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=19 → 8 steps (+1→/2→/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)
  n=20 → 7 steps (/2→/2→+1→/2→+1→/2→/2)

=== Total Steps up to N ===
  N=    10: sum=      35 (recur: 35) ✓
  N=   100: sum=     830 (recur: 830) ✓
  N=  1000: sum=   13022 (recur: 13022) ✓
